        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Peter Pan Live!\n- Places: Grumman Studios, Bethpage, New York\n- People: Allison Williams, Christopher Walken\n- Works: Peter Pan, The Deer Hunter\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor\n- Roles: Captain Hook, Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Pan Live! featured a live television production of the 1954 musical adaptation of Peter Pan from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York.\n- Allison Williams starred in Peter Pan Live! in the title role.\n- Christopher Walken portrayed Captain Hook in Peter Pan Live!.\n- Christopher Walken won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for portraying Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in The Deer Hunter.",
